{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2022-01-25 09:00:00', 'title': 'PLEX SYSTEMS RECEIVES IDC 2021 SAAS CUSTOMER SATISFACTION AWARD FOR ERP', 'text': 'TROY, MICH., JAN. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PLEX SYSTEMS, A ROCKWELL AUTOMATION COMPANY AND THE LEADER IN CLOUD-DELIVERED SMART MANUFACTURING SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS RECEIVED THE IDC 2021 SAAS CSAT CUSTOMER SATISFACTION AWARD FOR ERP.'}